  "description": "The Rambler is a Gravel / Bikepacking beast geared toward control, durability and functionality. This rig comes standard with a steel fork (Carbon fork optional) Rack and water bottle mounts where you want them, and UDH rear dropouts. With clearance for 700 x 2.25\" rubber and a 70.5 degree head tube angle The Rambler makes rocky, squirrely descending a breeze. Add Dynamo routing or trick it out however you want to roll. Camping boss / Gravel daddy or a plush upright townie. SPLATTER PAINT INCLUDED! :) MORE DETAILS / GEOMETRY / PHOTOS / VIDEO BELOW. Pricing is for frame and fork. (custom racks not included but available upon request!)",
